      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{640c76efcced024514ae4d6a|full_name} I also think the ranks need updating. The Poor rank for example is not meaningfully different from Medium other than having double the material slots and a light source. The triangle count should probably be increased so the rank can be more useful.\n\nPoor rank on Android has different triangle limits from Medium too.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
